WEBVTT

00:01.688 --> 00:07.308
This is Samantha. A small AI that lives on your Mac. Free, and private.

00:07.358 --> 00:18.433
She paints from thirty thousand squares. She draws anything you can name.

00:18.483 --> 00:35.389
She runs your Mac. Volume, screenshots, your apps.

00:35.439 --> 00:41.484
She keeps your notes and reminders.

00:41.534 --> 00:55.286
She finds your files.

00:55.336 --> 01:11.000
She does the math and converts units.

01:11.050 --> 01:18.621
Ask her anything. On a real Mac she researches with sources, reads your screen and clicks for you. She always asks first.

01:18.671 --> 01:22.498
Free. Private. Download her for Mac.

